# One line ending everywhere.
#
# Without this, Git checks out CRLF on Windows and LF on the Netlify build
# box, so the same file hashes differently in the two places. The asset
# stamps are content hashes, which made check-live report a stale deploy for
# three files nobody had touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
